{"synopsis":"Suatu hari, seorang warga biasa bernama Kang Woo-jin tiba-tiba mendapatkan kemampuan untuk masuk ke dalam ruang kosong jika melihat naskah atau skenario, dan melalui ruang kosong tersebut, dia bisa menjadi peran itu sendiri. Ketika dia mengikuti teman ke tempat audisi, secara kebetulan dia menunjukkan akting yang dia alami melalui ruang kosong…\nTiba-tiba, mereka bilang aku adalah monster yang luar biasa. Jadi? Aku hanya mengangguk.","alternative_title":"대뜸 착각당했다 괴물 천재배우로","author":"Jangtan, Jungseong Manyeo","artist":"Haega","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"430a3ff6-3f23-4bfc-81b6-166aa63691b0","number":"109","chapter":"109","title":"","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27"},{"chapter_id":"73ad0a8b-3a3f-474e-a4fc-fac4628625be","number":"108","chapter":"108","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"dfe62e48-773e-4e1a-b36f-dfcbe65b1df2","number":"107","chapter":"107","title":"","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08"},{"chapter_id":"dae0db03-6113-48a5-ba3f-937c1ccde288","number":"106","chapter":"106","title":"","date":"2026-07-03","released":"2026-07-03"},{"chapter_id":"ee5c3092-a9a0-4ffd-b165-6b2708f264f0","number":"105","chapter":"105","title":"","date":"2026-06-22","released":"2026-06-22"},{"chapter_id":"8a56ebb1-ca60-4fa7-978e-8fd524f58e64","number":"104","chapter":"104","title":"","date":"2026-06-16","released":"2026-06-16"},{"chapter_id":"4d040798-9964-4ee3-8b1a-44d65f0c0693","number":"103","chapter":"103","title":"","date":"2026-06-15","released":"2026-06-15"},{"chapter_id":"332c20a3-04a6-45d9-b24e-4a9babd19aea","number":"102","chapter":"102","title":"","date":"2026-06-11","released":"2026-06-11"},{"chapter_id":"36c401ef-a280-4a4b-a776-a9bb39b59ffc","number":"101","chapter":"101","title":"","date":"2026-05-26","released":"2026-05-26"},{"chapter_id":"99454df1-c420-490f-a62d-788a49c8e99a","number":"100","chapter":"100","title":"","date":"2026-05-26","released":"2026-05-26"},{"chapter_id":"18aedc7d-3be3-45a5-a013-5877